claim_principal: codex-pm-ecosystem
author: codex-pm-ecosystem
acceptance_criteria: Exact installed dependency versions are verified; package checks and real CLI acceptance pass without weakened gates; independent coverage and privacy limitations remain explicit
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T20:48:04.690Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"Validation on 2026-09-07: npm run release:check passed with installed PM CLI/SDK 2026.9.7. tests 115 pass 115 fail 0 skipped 0 all files |  74.13 |    80.30 |   82.61 | . This certifies the existing gates; it does not certify unmeasured source files, an absent statement metric, historical privacy, or production integration with every external provider. Exact-head CI and review are pending."
  "2026-09-07T21:31:37.310Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"2026-09-07 UTC independent local workspace gate: pm health --strict-exit --json fails on merge_receipts_pending:2. Supported pm merge reconcile --dry-run refuses with no_receipt_set_proves_snapshot. History validation reports no drift or invalid stream; old pending receipt snapshots cannot prove the later item state. Receipts and prior history remain preserved. The passing release:check does not clear this local strict-health gate."
